nux | v24.21.0 | 11.19.0 | Passed |\n| Windows | v22.23.3 | 10.9.9 | Passed |\n| Windows | v24.21.0 | 11.19.0 | Passed |\n\nAll six cases matched the tested tarball, used empty caches and anonymous npm configuration, and verified independent byte totals, budgets, exit codes, malformed inputs and atomic output. Registry signatures and Sigstore provenance were independently verified with npm audit signatures; the attestation matches this commit, tag and release.yml workflow.\n\nPackage archive SHA-256: `1caf85d79f2c3f6528e5563a962d0fac30686b7ec7ad3001f19283704f63f5e8`. Raw receipts and the verified provenance bundle are attached in the verification archive. [Changelog](https://github.com/Lingikaushikreddy/release-lens/blob/v0.1.1/CHANGELOG.md).\n"}